    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Look, the drivers are getting really loud about these new shift rotations. They're claiming the back-to-back scheduling is causing burnout and making it dangerous. I need you to draft a formal justification for these specific schedules for the board. It needs to sound airtight—focus on how these shifts maximize our throughput and, more importantly, frame them as being fully compliant with all safety and rest period regulations. We can't have them stalling operations because of these complaints.",
